 and possible COHb exposure levels</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Sealed battery for the life of the unit, no replacements required</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Versatile- Table top, portable, and wall mount options included</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">The only unit available to focus on below 50 PPM levels only</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-family: Assistant, sans-serif; font-weight: var(--font-heading-weight); color: rgb(var(--color-foreground)); line-height: calc(1 + .3/max(1,var(--font-heading-scale))); word-break: break-word; font-size: calc(var(--font-heading-scale) * 2.4rem); white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;Specifications:</h2>\r\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style-position: inside; padding-left: 2rem; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Assistant, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style: inherit;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Color:&nbsp;</strong>White</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style: inherit;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Power source:&nbsp;</strong>Battery powered</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style: inherit;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Size:&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>4 oz</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style: inherit;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">Warranty:</strong>&nbsp; 3 years</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">SKU#-</strong>2016-10</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.75); font-family: Assistant, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">When it comes 